            "context": "A partner criticizes you for not coming at the agreed time and asks you to come tomorrow. You acknowledge the missed meeting and apologize. You agree to tomorrow, but the time tomorrow is not yet agreed. Respond to the criticism and clarify that remaining detail; no other fault has been alleged.\nFamiliar meanings available: to answer; to respond; to apologize; to criticize; criticism; sorry; to agree; to consent.",
